// Why we put last console statement at last because 
// if we put inside loop it print intermediate value at every step
// EX- fact = 1
//fact = 2
//fact = 6
//fact = 24
//fact = 120
//fact = 720
// after executing loop then it prints final output

using System;
class LoopDemo1
{
static void Main()
{
 Console.Write("Enter a number: ");
 int num = int.Parse(Console.ReadLine());
 int fact = 1;
 for(int i=1;i<=num;i++)
{
 fact *= i;
}
Console.WriteLine($"factorial of {num} = {fact}");
}
}
